  "readmeFile": "Package.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Targets .NET 10 and .NET 11; removes .NET 8 support. Removes SchedulingSetup and IsWired; share one ScheduleService across registration and firing. Backend capability checks now take CanExpress(cron, recurring). ScheduleListItem uses named properties. Failed creation and cancellation retain cleanup and native command failure context.",
